@startuml verification-status-flow

title Requirement Verification Status Flow

[*] --> NotTested : Requirement\naccepted

NotTested --> TestcaseCreated : Test case\ndeveloped

TestcaseCreated --> InProgress : Testing\nstarted

InProgress --> Passed : All test cases\npassed
InProgress --> Failed : One or more\ntest cases failed

Failed --> TestcaseCreated : Test case\nupdated
Failed --> InProgress : Retest after\nbug fix

Passed --> [*]

note right of NotTested
Initial state for all
accepted requirements.
No test case exists yet.
end note

note right of TestcaseCreated
Test case TC-SYS-XXX or
TC-SW-XXX has been created
and reviewed.
end note

note right of Passed
Requirement is fully
verified and meets all
acceptance criteria.
end note

note right of Failed
Requirement verification
failed. Root cause analysis
and corrective action needed.
end note

@enduml